<title>USA: Webco Industries names officer.</title>
<headline>Webco Industries names officer.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Webco Industries Inc said on Monday it named Mike Howard as chief financial officer, replacing Harry Dandelles.</p>
<p>Dandelles left to pursue other interests, the company said. Prior to joining Webco, Howard was vice president of finance and chief financial officer of Multimedia Games Inc, which provides linked high-stakes games and develops software for the gaming industry.</p>
<p>Previously, he spent over ten years with Coopers &amp; Lybrand, serving in various positions in the business assurance practice, the company said.</p>
</text>
